<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for export of a 100-pound (45.36 kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective from April 3 to April 9.</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 181.16</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 174.93</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  60.18</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 139.89</p>
</text>
